        <h1>About Us</h1>

        <h2 id="who-we-are">Who We Are</h2>
        <p>We are a passionate community of experienced Delta Force: Hawk Ops players who have dedicated hundreds of hours to mastering every aspect of the game. Our team includes former competitive FPS players, content creators, and dedicated grinders who have been following the Delta Force franchise since its early days.</p>
        <p>What started as a small Discord group sharing tips and strategies has grown into a comprehensive resource used by thousands of players worldwide.</p>

        <h2 id="our-mission">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>Our mission is simple: <strong>provide the most comprehensive, accurate, and up-to-date English-language Delta Force: Hawk Ops guide on the internet.</strong> We aim to be the first stop for any player looking to improve their game.</p>

        <h2 id="what-we-cover">What We Cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Game Modes</strong> — Havoc Operations and All-Out Warfare strategy guides</li>
          <li><strong>Operators</strong> — Ability breakdowns, playstyles, synergies, and counters</li>
          <li><strong>Weapons</strong> — Meta tier lists, budget builds, modification codes, recoil analysis</li>
          <li><strong>Maps</strong> — Loot locations, knife run routes, extraction points</li>
          <li><strong>Economy</strong> — Havoc Coins strategies, loot valuation, funding loadouts</li>
          <li><strong>Beginner Resources</strong> — Essential tips, common mistakes, movement mechanics</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="contact-us">Contact Us</h2>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> ben357753@163.com</p>
        <p>You can also reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>

